flowchart TB
    Start([Start]) --> Open[Open PROTECT]
    Open --> Access{Public or staff?}

    Access -->|Public| PublicPortal[Public announcements portal]
    PublicPortal --> ReadNotices[Read active announcements]
    PublicPortal --> SubmitNeeds[Submit community needs]
    ReadNotices --> PublicDone([Public flow complete])
    SubmitNeeds --> PublicDone

    Access -->|Staff| Login[Staff login]
    Login --> Auth{Credentials accepted?}
    Auth -->|No| Login
    Auth -->|Yes| Role{Role assigned?}
    Role -->|No| Restricted[Access restricted]
    Role -->|Yes| Dashboard[Community Dashboard]
    Dashboard --> Choose{Choose feature}

    Choose --> Resident[Resident Profiling] --> A((A))
    Choose --> QR[QR Verification] --> B((B))
    Choose --> GIS[GIS Household Map] --> C((C))
    Choose --> Disaster[Disaster Vulnerability] --> D((D))
    Choose --> Crime[Crime & Incident] --> E((E))
    Choose --> Hotspot[Crime Hotspot Map] --> F((F))
    Choose --> Beneficiary[Beneficiary Tracking] --> G((G))
    Choose --> Analytics[Analytics: Population, Poverty, Sectors] --> H((H))
    Choose --> Predictive[Predictive Growth] --> I((I))
    Choose --> AnnNeeds[Announcements & Needs Assessment] --> J((J))
    Choose --> Reports[DILG Reports] --> K((K))
    Choose --> Users[User Management] --> L((L))
    Choose --> Audit[System Audit & Backup/Restore] --> M((M))
    Choose --> Ordinance[Ordinance Archive] --> O((O))

    R((R: Dashboard)) -->|Return after module task| Dashboard
    P((P: Public portal)) -->|Public flow returns| PublicPortal
    ConnectorGuide[ A–M and O enter their matching module flowcharts.<br/>Staff modules exit through R to Dashboard.<br/>Public announcement and needs flows exit through P. ]
    ConnectorGuide -.-> R

    Logout([Staff logs out])
    Dashboard -. Logout option .-> Logout

